invariant: INV-14
file: webpki_cfg.c
catches: quic_loop_webpki
reason: the SPKI pin rule admits one pin over CH_SPKI_PIN_MAX, and
  ch_quic_init takes that rule from webpki_cfg_ok, so a QUIC config
  accepts five pins. test/quic_loop_pins.h's first-invalid count rows,
  with a hostname and anchors and with pins alone, object.

--- old
    return cfg->spki_pin_count > 0 && cfg->spki_pin_count <= CH_SPKI_PIN_MAX;
--- new
    return cfg->spki_pin_count > 0 && cfg->spki_pin_count <= CH_SPKI_PIN_MAX + 1;
